	<section_number>15.2-2637</section_number>
	<catch_line>Danville to incur indebtedness only in accordance with charter</catch_line>
	<text>
		In the City of Danville no money shall be borrowed, no bonds issued and no indebtedness incurred under this chapter except in accordance with the terms of its charter.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 15-666.24; 1958, c. 640; 1962, c. 623, § 15.1-181; 1970, c. 209; 1991, c. 668, § 15.1-227.38; 1997, c. 587.</history>
